    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2517060/extras/7c15b40b3d8ef9f33dc8fb4147f99a25.avif?t=1714757180\" /></span><br>Buy or find a variety of cars, including sports cars, classic models, and exotic vehicles, and start tuning them in<strong> &quot;Tune My Car - Tuning Studio &amp; Car Mechanic Simulator 2023</strong>&quot;. You'll be able to customize every detail, bringing your ideas to life. Change the body, install aerodynamic kits, choose unique wheels and tuning parts to give your car a distinctive style.<br>But tuning is not just about the exterior. In<strong> &quot;Tune My Car - Tuning Studio &amp; Car Mechanic Simulator 2023&quot;</strong>, you can improve the car's performance by tuning the engine, exhaust system, suspension, and transmission. Unlock various modifications to achieve maximum power and dynamics for your car.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2517060/extras/6e1aaa334305abc14b40d7358138edee.poster.avif?t=1714757180\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2517060/extras/6e1aaa334305abc14b40d7358138edee.webm?t=1714757180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2517060/extras/6e1aaa334305abc14b40d7358138edee.mp4?t=1714757180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Gradually expand your workshop, acquire new tools and equipment to tackle even the most challenging tuning projects. Fulfill orders from clients who expect you to create their dream on wheels. Showcase your skills and creative approach to meet the most demanding requests. After completing the work, take your car for a test drive, experience it on racing tracks and city streets.<br>Unleash your talents and create the most beautiful and powerful cars. Are you ready to take on the challenge and turn ordinary cars into works of art?<br><strong>Game Features:</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2517060/extras/953a59520cce6104ac2d640c338dc316.poster.avif?t=1714757180\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2517060/extras/953a59520cce6104ac2d640c338dc316.webm?t=1714757180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2517060/extras/953a59520cce6104ac2d640c338dc316.mp4?t=1714757180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Wide selection of cars</strong>: Choose from a diverse range of car models, including sports cars, classic models, and exotic vehicles.<br><strong>Extensive tuning options</strong>: Customize every detail of your car, from body modifications and aerodynamic kits to unique wheels and tuning parts, to create a unique style. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2517060/extras/463c110d3d07f6b0395d08be3385c78e.poster.avif?t=1714757180\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2517060/extras/463c110d3d07f6b0395d08be3385c78e.webm?t=1714757180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2517060/extras/463c110d3d07f6b0395d08be3385c78e.mp4?t=1714757180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Performance enhancement</strong>: Improve your car's performance by tuning the engine, exhaust system, suspension, and transmission to achieve maximum power and dynamics. <br><strong>Expansion of the workshop</strong>: Gradually expand your tuning workshop by acquiring new tools and equipment to take on more challenging projects. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2517060/extras/af02f592277d71b693a7ea87a245af62.poster.avif?t=1714757180\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2517060/extras/af02f592277d71b693a7ea87a245af62.webm?t=1714757180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2517060/extras/af02f592277d71b693a7ea87a245af62.mp4?t=1714757180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Test drive and racing</strong>: Take your customized car for a test drive on racing tracks and city streets, evaluating its performance in practice. <br><strong>Creative self-expression</strong>: Unleash your creative energy and turn ordinary cars into stunning works of art on wheels.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2517060/extras/fd49081de52303aa4e1fc297942ab977.avif?t=1714757180\" /></span>",
